  "notes": "This dependency-closed integration requires every v1alpha1 EvidenceRef-to-EvidenceBundle candidate to carry a bounded VerificationStateHistory and independent effective/recorded as-of instants. The resolver shares the standard-library validation and replay implementation with the existing history validator, binds history subject identity to the EvidenceRef, preserves ERROR > DENIED > UNRESOLVED > RESOLVED precedence, and exposes a bundle identifier only for RESOLVED. ACTIVE history is necessary but never sufficient; corrected, superseded, revoked, unknown, subject-mismatched, malformed, or temporally inconsistent history fails closed. No schema, live source, policy evaluation, public projection, lifecycle, release, deployment, publication, or repository-setting state is created or changed. Rollback is a normal revert of this integration commit."
